                <h2>Example SQL Query:</h2>
                
                <div class="sql-code">
                <pre><code>
    SELECT Name, Breed
    FROM Dogs
    WHERE Age > 3;
                </code></pre>
                </div>

                <p>
                    This SQL query returns the names and breeds of all dogs older than 3 years.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Cujo Chihuahua
                </p>

